msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:93
#: 3767ab4a47ca4243853f54f5c785d9e1
msgid "Backing away from obstacles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:95
#: 20cff150fc5b46deab988cfd69b9ddaa
msgid "The vehicle will actively attempt to maintain distance (margin) from obstacles. This means that if an obstacle approaches the vehicle from any direction, and the sensor detects it, the vehicle will back away from the obstacle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:108
#: 16065b613472400ba3d538d3ea774b88
msgid "The speed of this backing away can be controlled via the parameter: :ref:`AVOID_BACKUP_SPD <AVOID_BACKUP_SPD>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:109
#: 2ec28914088c4e77834b86d32167d92e
msgid "Setting this parameter to zero would disable backing up. Therefore, the vehicle will attempt to stop or slide in front of the obstacle, but never try and maintain a margin from the obstacle if it was to come closer due to any reason."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:114
#: 15f93ab733024024a96192eb8264a45c
msgid "Getting smoother avoidance experience"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:116
#: 315ecf07b0c54cae83adcacff93a7bcf
msgid "Depending on the tuning of the vehicle, current velocity, distance to the obstacle; the user might feel that while avoidance is active, the vehicle response is very \"jerky\" and not smooth."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:117
#: 281e331d76a3405080534de21b2638dc
msgid "In this case, user should reduce the maximum acceleration with which the vehicle would avoid obstacles. See the parameter :ref:`AVOID_ACCEL_MAX <AVOID_ACCEL_MAX>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:119
#: 1f5a1395fbe04ec89e1774626503a0a3
msgid "Setting :ref:`AVOID_ACCEL_MAX <AVOID_ACCEL_MAX>` too low would mean that the response to the obstacle will be very sluggish and the vehicle may not be able to stop in time. Therefore, be careful while pushing this parameter to extremes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:123
#: 592af540c88744dd824cc489c3083f3e
msgid "Minimum altitude (Copter only)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:125
#: 226305f7de4249698287cc6eddf9feef
msgid "If the sensor has a wide field of view, on takeoff and landings it might see the ground below as obstacle and the vehicle might react to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:126
#: aef0f9b817d34e37beedb0479de7d7e8
msgid "Set the parameter :ref:`AVOID_ALT_MIN <AVOID_ALT_MIN>` to have a minimum altitude before avoidance is switched on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:128
#: 263d4474d65245948ac158b9ca206bf4
msgid "This feature requires a valid Downward Facing Rangefinder reading to works"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-simple-object-avoidance.rst:133
#: a697d8eaaf114539b1e3842b832fce1b
